  "video_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wz2JXR9gb24",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Concealed Carry 3 Season Jacket provides the ultimate comfort and warmth throughout the fall, winter, and spring while allowing you to easily carry your gear and essentials. This tactical jacket is perfect for active-duty personnel, outdoor enthusiasts, everyday use, and more. Whether you're heading out for a day on the range, working in public safety, or just running errands around town, this CCW jacket has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "9303",
  "description": "<p>Our Concealed Carry 3 Season Jacket provides the ultimate comfort and warmth throughout the fall, winter, and spring while allowing you to easily carry your gear and essentials. This tactical jacket is perfect for active-duty personnel, outdoor enthusiasts, everyday use, and more. Whether you're heading out for a day on the range, working in public safety, or just running errands around town, this CCW jacket has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Ample Storage and Utility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These outdoor jackets feature 4 inner mag pockets and 2 conceal flap pockets, all of which use hook and loop closures to secure your firearm. The conceal flap pockets are padded to help prevent printing while offering additional comfort.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tackle the Cold:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The warm quilted liner helps with heat insulation and retention, while the washed 100% cotton outer shell shields you from harsh outdoor elements. This combination allows you to remain comfortable and at-the-ready, no matter the season.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The Perfect Fit:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keep the warmth in and the cold out by adjusting the field jacket&rsquo;s double-button wrist cuffs and double-button waist straps.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Heavy-Duty Zippers:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The brass-finished two-way zipper on the front has an interior storm placket and can be opened top or bottom for quick and easy access to your items, even during critical moments and emergencies. Along with keeping your hands warm, the tricot lined zipper pockets offer additional space to secure your belongings.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Discreetly Carry in Confidence:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rothco stands out as the leader in concealed carry clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective CCW gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of specialized concealed carry items. From public safety and military personnel, to privately armed citizens, Rothco is the go-to brand for concealed carry apparel and gear.</li>\n</ul>",
